  IF SY-SUBRC EQ 0.

    " Ten Cong ty/Don vi tieng Anh
    CLEAR: E_NAME_N_TITLE.
    IF LW_NAME2 IS INITIAL AND LW_NAME3 IS INITIAL AND LW_NAME4 IS INITIAL.
